    <briefdescription>
<para>Taiwanese calendars. </para>    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Holidays for the <ref refid="class_quant_lib_1_1_taiwan" kindref="compound">Taiwan</ref> stock exchange (data from <ulink url="http://www.tse.com.tw/en/trading/trading_days.php">http://www.tse.com.tw/en/trading/trading_days.php</ulink>): <itemizedlist>
<listitem>
<para>Saturdays </para></listitem>
<listitem>
<para>Sundays </para></listitem>
<listitem>
<para>New Year&apos;s Day, January 1st </para></listitem>
<listitem>
<para>Peace Memorial Day, February 28 </para></listitem>
<listitem>
<para>Labor Day, May 1st </para></listitem>
<listitem>
<para>Double Tenth National Day, October 10th </para></listitem>
</itemizedlist>
</para><para>Other holidays for which no rule is given (data available for 2002-2011 only:) <itemizedlist>
<listitem>
<para>Chinese Lunar New Year </para></listitem>
<listitem>
<para>Tomb Sweeping Day </para></listitem>
<listitem>
<para>Dragon Boat Festival </para></listitem>
<listitem>
<para>Moon Festival </para></listitem>
</itemizedlist>
</para>    </detaileddescription>
